<Base lang="en" title={ui.en.consultationTitle + ui.en.suffix}>
<div class="ids__wrapper S">
<div class="ids__space XL"></div>
<h1>Consultations on career, portfolio, education and doubts for designers</h1>
<div class="ids__space M"></div>
<i>For students</i>
<div class="ids__space S"></div>
<p>For you, consultations are pay-what-you-want. At this age there’s huge potential that often gets crushed by the cost of consultations, courses and professionals’ egos. Something completely free loses a lot of its value, so there is still a minimum. It will be useful for:</p>
<ul>
<li>High school students in grades 9–11</li>
<li>College, bachelor’s and master’s students in any field</li>
</ul>
<p>What you’ll get (really, anything you want to ask that I can find an answer to, for example):</p>
<ul>
<li>A review of your resources: website, portfolio, channel, résumé</li>
<li>An assessment of how in demand and competitive you are in design</li>
<li>Next steps to help you level up</li>
<li>Answers to any questions about career, design, education and growth in your field</li>
</ul>
<div class="ids__space M"></div>
<i>For hard-working kittens</i>
<div class="ids__space S"></div>
<p>For you, a consultation costs 5,000₽. It will be useful for:</p>
<ul>
<li>Beginner designers looking for their first job</li>
<li>Interns, juniors and mid-level designers who want to grow their career further and have run into difficulties</li>
</ul>
<p>What you’ll get (really, anything you want to ask that I can find an answer to, for example):</p>
<ul>
<li>A review of your resources: website, portfolio, channel, résumé</li>
<li>Finding the root of the problem you’re facing</li>
<li>Looking together for a solution that fits your values and life context</li></ul>
<div class="ids__space M"></div>
<h2>To book, <a href="https://t.me/nikita_nova">write to me</a> in a private message</h2>
<div class="ids__space XL"></div>
<h2>And to help you decide, you can read what questions other people came to me with and what they think after our meeting</h2>
<div class="ids__space M"></div>
</div>
<div class="ids__wrapper L">
<div class="project-gallery">
