<div class="ids__space S"></div>
<i>Thank you so much — I guess the thought above is the main thing I was supposed to take away) To finally sit down and make my portfolio the way I want it, work on its quality and use your video (I saw you just posted it; we talked about it at the consultation)</i>
</div>
