<figure>
<div class="card">
<h4>Polya. I don’t understand where to go next. Look at my portfolio and Telegram channel and tell me what you think</h4>
<i>A pleasant experience, comments to the point. I haven’t fully reflected on everything that was said yet. But some words really stuck, and now I walk around thinking about them)</i>
<div class="ids__space S"></div>
<i>The good part: you’re engaged. You can feel the person cares and really wants to help. It was nice to see some examples of good work; maybe there could have been more. Say, “here are a couple of dudes with different approaches to portfolios, you can do it the way you think is right”, to lock in the idea that a portfolio doesn’t have to be a cliché. Although on the other hand, it’s not your job to reinforce things in a person’s mind, so that’s kind of optional)</i>
<div class="ids__space S"></div>
<i>Now, with everything I do, I ask myself: is this my own drive, or did someone else put it into my head?</i>
</div>
